    // 0x1030 was named reticleCenterSize and is not: it reads 0 on 17 of the 29 weapons drawing
    // reticle_center_cross, which Black Ops 3 draws at 32 on 39 of 41, and 0 on the hatchet,
    // frag grenade and minigun the two titles share, which Black Ops 3 sizes 42, 32 and 37. As an
    // integer its zero was written and raised to the entry's least, so every weapon carried a
    // centre reticle one pixel across. What it holds is not known, so it is left unnamed; the
    // size is implied from the reticle image instead, in porting.jsonc.

