    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    // Read out of the game's own accessor for each field, disassembled from the decrypted exe.
    // A field with no offset of its own is worked out when asked,
    // and the code that works it out still has to read whatever it is worked out from: a weapon
    // reaches this struct through `[weapon + 0xa38]`, so a read of `[that + n]` is a field at n.
    //
    // Every one of these was then checked against the game's own field dump across the 118 weapons
